* More than one Suspicious object can appear at a time.
* The Suspicious Object respawns immediately in a different location. So far the point can appear at:

:* (c-6) - Inside and to left in Mansion area.
:* (D-7) - barely NE of {n:Adjutant}.
:* (D-7) - top step of stairs.
:* (D-8) - halfway up stairs to Leathercraft Guild Shop area.
