:* (F-6) - behind Captured Orc.
:* (F-9) - 2 paces NE of mini door.
:* (G-9) - On the ramp in front of Westgate, or on the second floor NW of {n:Aurfet}.
:* (H-9) - few yalms south of {p:Quartermaster}
:* (I-9) - 10 yalms north of {n:Rasdinice}.
:* (I-11) - ~5 yalms east of {n:Sabiliont}.
:* (J-9) - near {n:Voucheramme}.
:* (J-10) - at North East exit from Chocobo Stable area.
